      "side": 1,
      "message": "My one concern about this is, this isn\u0027t a dmabuf heaps driver, more of a platform specific reserved memory driver, so it probably shouldn\u0027t be in the drivers/dma-buf/headps dir. Maybe somewhere in drivers/soc/tegra instead?\n\nI\u0027m surprised though, is module init really too late for this sort of reservation?",
